# Allow-list, not a deny-list: the build context is only what the image copies. Everything
# else stays out, above all .env and .demo-keys.json, which hold Devnet seeds.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/**
!demo/**
# The Devnet transactions the history routes fall back on once Devnet prunes them. Without this
# line the image starts, logs that it has no archive, and the history of the event goes missing.
!evidence/devnet-tx/**
